#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/overview.adoc
msgid ""
"These pages give insight into **how selected OpenEMS functions work**: what "
"they do, when they intervene, what can be set and what to watch out for. "
"They are aimed at users and operators, not at developers. They are based on "
"the current OpenEMS source code (as of the end of October 2026)."
msgstr ""

